 * platform marks are multi-element ('kind' => 'raw', full inner markup with
 * fills already normalised to currentColor). Icons are the minimalist social
 * pack (Simple Icons, CC0; identifier and wordmark glyphs redrawn to match);
 * see assets/icons/social/PACK-README.txt.
 *
 * @package Murtadd
 */

